      "id": 136849,
      "name": "AlexxKay",
      "username": "AlexxKay",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-08T16:29:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One strategy that applies to multiple environments: If the environment has any \"skip your turn to (Prevent Awfulness)\" cards, take that into effect when ordering your heroes during setup.&nbsp; Put someone first on the rotation who you don't mind skipping their turn every now and then.&nbsp; Especially good candidates are Unity and Omnitron-X, as each has many cards that let them act during the Start of Turn phase, so can still get a lot done while \"skipping\" a turn.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
